e at Homo Beerhouse 4, Barbauld-street 120 102 50 Railway Tavern, Bee ' rhouse. 2, Factory-lane 80 68 72 Black Horse, Boathouse, 272, Liverpool-road 50 43 I 60 Coach and Horses, Full Licence, 81, Liverpool-road 1150 127 1 120 Ring-s -Bells, Beerbonse, 35, Wilderspoot Causeway 80 68 • •70 Royal Oak Branch, Beerhouse, It, Enultsford-road 8) 69 72 Roan Cow, Reerhouse, 8, Knu.sford-road 80 68 65 Brook Inn, Boerhouse, 559, Knotsford-road 80 CR 00 Railway Inn, Beerhouse, 68(1, Knutsferd-road 75 63 72 Bewsey Inn, Beerhouse, 2, Pitt-street 65 55 10 Stocks Hotel, Full Licence, Padgate 65 55 u 50 Plough Inn, Beerhouse, Croft 40 34 0 30 Rose Inn, Beerhouse, Hood-lane 51) 42 10 141 Chapel House, Burtonwood 75 63 15 55 Chapel House Hotel, Great Sankey 90 76 10 75 Butchers Arms, Great Sankey 25 29 15 25 13r0a3 Oak, Great Sankey 30 25 10 25 Crown lon, Penkettl 50 42 10 50 0</p>
